{"review_id": "fa60d3df-28e8-4b6f-9b6a-906afb63b6a0", "package": "daily.planner.routine.habits", "app_name": "Me+ Lifestyle Routine", "language": "he", "language_name": "Hebrew", "rating": 3, "text": "The app looks great, it's very friendly, very beautiful, the colours are really calming.. Unfortunately, you can add up to 3 \"routines\" with no payment, and it gives you a 7 days trial only if you put a credit card, something I'm not ready to do on a new app. I'm suggesting to let people try your app first and getting used to it and enjoying it for a limited time before they need to put payment.", "author": "Adi Almog", "date": "2023-08-15T01:03:19Z", "thumbs_up": 21, "app_version": null, "developer_reply": null}
